### 0. Логин как chief
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sergey@example.com",
  "password": "secret12345"
}

### 1. Создать этап (замените PROJECT_ID)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/projects/1d050f9c-19bb-4ca0-9464-a6e080550e1f/stages
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Фундамент",
  "description": "Заливка фундамента под 5-этажный дом",
  "deadline": "2026-12-15"
}

### 2. Список этапов
GET http://localhost:3000/api/projects/1d050f9c-19bb-4ca0-9464-a6e080550e1f/stages
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3. Получить один (замените STAGE_ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/projects/1d050f9c-19bb-4ca0-9464-a6e080550e1f/stages/2c0e7c1f-018c-4c5e-a5f2-a6a13b1fcc64
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. Изменить статус: draft → pending_approval
POST http://localhost:3000/api/projects/1d050f9c-19bb-4ca0-9464-a6e080550e1f/stages/2c0e7c1f-018c-4c5e-a5f2-a6a13b1fcc64/status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "pending_approval",
  "comment": "Отправлено на утверждение"
}

### 5. Пропустить статус: draft → completed (должно быть 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/projects/1d050f9c-19bb-4ca0-9464-a6e080550e1f/stages/2c0e7c1f-018c-4c5e-a5f2-a6a13b1fcc64/status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed"
}

### 6. История статусов
GET http://localhost:3000/api/projects/1d050f9c-19bb-4ca0-9464-a6e080550e1f/stages/2c0e7c1f-018c-4c5e-a5f2-a6a13b1fcc64/history
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}